1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,400
Hello, Captain Aurélie.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,200
<i>The wind is rising over the coast…</i>

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,800
You're late.
Again.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
{\an8}SAINT-MALO HARBOUR — 1943

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,500
It'll be fine. I've seen worse,
believe me.

6
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:19,100
Where has <b>Édouard</b> gone?

7
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:22,600
<i>He slipped away quietly,
as usual.</i>

8
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,000
Very funny. Really very funny.

9
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:28,900
Don't forget: tomorrow at dawn,
everything must be ready.

10
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:34,000
See you tomorrow, Captain.

99
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,000
This line exists only in the translated file.
